WEBVTT

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.780
What a beautiful place.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:10.620
Mother.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.330
When the time comes, the seal
will be broken,

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.040
and I will have to fire this once again.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.250
Why am I trying to stay alive?

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.590
Let me out of here.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.880
The answer remains the same.

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:23.890
Lady Gabriel-

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.550
Listening to Gabriel will get you nowhere.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:30.930
Gabriel cannot save the world.

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:32.980
The only one who can save it...

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.400
is me.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.710
Why... why can't anybody understand?

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.330
Not even you, Mother.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.260
El seems a little upset by something.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:08.550
What? Don't worry about him.

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.180
I'm here!

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:14.140
This is not a playground.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.900
I know, I know!

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.270
Thank you, angel.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:21.440
My name is not Angel. It is Ridwan.

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:23.860
Copy that!

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:25.410
See you later, Ridwan!

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.660
Mugaro!

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:31.910
How have you been?

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:37.040
I'd leave him alone if I were you.

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:45.680
This looks just like Bacchus' carriage.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:49.430
Speaking of the carriage, I hope Hippogriff is doing well.

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:53.640
Hippogriff is! I mean, we came here together after all.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:57.230
Really? I'm surprised you made it through the barrier.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:00.230
Barrier? You mean that lightning?

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:04.740
For that, Granny just threw us,
and it was over when I came to.

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.700
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:11.990
That reminds me of the day
we ditched this place.

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.790
Really we were just exiled.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:17.540
Why did you leave the land of the gods,
Bacchus?

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:23.050
Getting worshiped and pampered
as a god wasn't really my style.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:28.090
So I threw it all away and flew off with Hippogriff.

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:30.890
What's so funny?

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.640
That's so cool!

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.310
Right? Hear that, Hamsa?

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.140
Wanna come join us?

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:45.190
He talks cool, but he fell head over heels
for this human woman and chased after her.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:50.280
For real? You get crushes too, Bacchus?

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:53.580
No, you idiots!

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.790
That's hilarious!

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.580
Are you blushing? Are you blushing, Bacchus?

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:59.620
No making fun of grown-ups!

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:00.920
He's totally blushing.

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.400
You're leaving?

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:34.080
Do you know your way back to your room?

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.990
Rage of Bahamut

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.910
They are the same
and lose themselves

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:23.170
Cuz there are lots of roads to go
And the path suddenly seems rougher

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:28.590
I wanna walk straight ahead
Knock down another dream

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:33.970
Most broke before they ever came true

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:38.180
But walk this way

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.270
Get out of my way

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:51.280
Depends on the way you think it
To a yielding heart

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:55.950
the future, hope,
despair and worry all look all the same

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:02.250
So much that you'll turn down the truth
that lied to you that day

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:06.960
when you were prepared for it all.
You go your way, don't you?

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:11.420
But walk this way

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:16.510
Get out of my way

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:21.560
But walk this way

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.540
We meet again.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:47.710
You're adorable.

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:49.710
Huh!

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:53.550
You are always cute, but that is
especially true today.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.050
Really...

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.240
Oh, no.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.660
I'm going to...

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:22.870
I'm going to transform into a killer dragon.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:39.840
I can't even reach on my tiptoes?

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:41.550
Do I jump?

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.230
Kill them all!

00:07:00.910 --> 00:07:01.950
No!

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:04.120
What?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.080
I think I just had a nightmare,

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.080
but I can't remember it.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.130
Bacchus! My clothes are gone!

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.180
Hamsa, my clothes are gone!

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:24.970
You're wearing them.
Are you sure you're awake yet?

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.220
Hey, Mugaro!

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:28.850
Mugaro is gone.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:34.190
What are you going on about?

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.230
But he's not here.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.490
Bacchus! El is gone!

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:46.830
Wake up! El is gone!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.830
What?

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:53.830
This is bad! We are going to be in so much trouble.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.670
I won't be able to drink my wine!

00:07:55.840 --> 00:08:01.840
That's the least of our problems!
Any more mistakes and we'll be exiled for sure!

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:19.690
Apparently Captain Kaisar's sentence
will be carried out soon.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.450
I wonder what's going to happen to us.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:24.450
You two there!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.580
Focus! We're in the middle of training!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.410
My apologies!

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.500
Getting irritated isn't going to solve anything.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:39.920
He brought this on himself by getting
idealistic and opposing the king.

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:43.340
He was wrong.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.490
What?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.200
Hey! What are you doing?

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.480
Do you want to get arrested too?

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:36.730
Kaisar Lidfard!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:41.480
Despite the weight of your responsibilities
as the captain of the Orleans Knights,

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:44.490
you plotted against His Majesty.

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:48.280
In addition, you fled from prison
amidst the chaos of battle,

00:09:48.450 --> 00:09:51.620
and repeated your crime of treason!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:55.120
There can be no justification for these crimes!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:59.340
You are accordingly sentenced to death
by combat against this demon!

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:12.560
Azazel...

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:20.650
What is it?

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:24.070
El said he'd like to go out and take a walk.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.450
-Hold on, I will go check.
-Okay.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:32.120
You were given permission as long
as I accompanied you. Come out.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.160
Such generosity!
Lady Gabriel is a wise and just leader.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:41.040
Where is that overly optimistic girl?

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.130
She returned to her room last night.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:49.680
That seems strange.
Jeanne did not mention her returning.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:54.680
That is not El!

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:05.990
Where could Mugaro be?

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:07.150
I don't know!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:10.530
It doesn't seem like
he went to see Jeanne.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:16.790
Mugaro was watching us the whole time when
Bacchus was talking about his exile last night.

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:18.160
I wasn't exiled!

00:11:18.710 --> 00:11:22.380
El did seem to want to get back to the surface.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.170
Hippogriff!

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.190
Lady Gabriel!

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:42.770
What is this commotion about?

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.610
I beg your pardon, my lady.

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:47.440
But El has escaped!

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:11.880
Hippo?

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:26.070
Rage of Bahamut

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:28.110
You can both die!

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:29.650
Traitor!

00:12:31.820 --> 00:12:33.660
What are you doing?

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:41.460
It's not like you to let them make a spectacle of you.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:54.340
Stop running away!

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:55.800
You're a disgrace, Captain!

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.810
Why are you not attacking?

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:04.440
It's hard with only one hand.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:12.530
Unless you want to die, kill me.

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.580
Bacchus, you go that way.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.630
Okay.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:33.630
Hamsa, you go that way.

00:13:33.800 --> 00:13:35.630
Copy that.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:41.600
I'll jump on Mugaro from up there.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.600
For the timing,

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:50.070
when I get to that spot

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:53.150
it'll be, "One, two, three, go!"

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:29.060
That wasn't the right timing at all!

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:31.190
We did exactly what you said!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:34.780
-Get off of me already, you pervert!
-Pervert?

00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.860
I guess we needed words
to communicate.

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.500
Nina!

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.380
Kaisar!

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:09.830
-Kill him!
-Do it already!

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:11.790
Hurry up and kill him!

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:19.010
I was stupid to ever expect anything from you.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.520
What are you doing?

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:30.730
Hey!

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:40.610
Azazel!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.450
What is going on?

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.830
Who cares! Keep going!

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.290
We can't see anything!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:57.170
Just as I thought,
that man will not die without a fight!

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:01.970
-Secure the perimeter!
-Don't let them escape!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:06.010
Don't run away, Mugaro!

00:17:06.180 --> 00:17:10.180
Jeanne will be really sad if you're gone!

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:21.530
Got you now!

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:56.480
Thank you, Mugaro!

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:58.730
You may have changed a little bit,

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.900
but you're still Mugaro!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:09.830
That barrier is bad news!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:14.750
There they are! They are the ones who let El go!

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:17.500
Bacchus, are you insane?

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.000
What?

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:24.210
Oh, no! They're going to kill us!

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:51.870
Get in!

00:19:01.250 --> 00:19:03.340
Good timing, Bacchus!

00:19:10.760 --> 00:19:12.890
Those fools!

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:17.480
El... why?

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:38.120
Once again, we left the land of the
gods in the worst way possible.

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.920
What are we going to do now?

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:49.720
We'll go back to Anatae.

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.180
You'll take me to the capital?

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.060
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.600
If you're planning to fight the humans,

00:19:58.850 --> 00:20:00.810
I'll hand you right back over to the gods.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:04.650
It's not that I want to fight.

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:08.110
I want to bring peace to the world.

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:12.450
This is great, isn't it, Mugaro?

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:16.370
But what about Jeanne?

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.790
I will fulfill my duty
for my mother's sake as well.

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:47.020
As horrible as you are
I can't help but love you

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:54.820
Even while I waited
That is all I felt

00:20:55.240 --> 00:21:03.040
Ephemeral lovers, both flawed and missing pieces
We have finally become one

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:10.420
in this miniature garden at the edge of sorrow
Can you hear my heart speaking?

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:18.720
Ah, I may no longer feel
that I want to go back in time

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:26.310
But there are feelings, feelings, feelings
I can only feel now

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:34.360
I want to run away with you, dancing
just like in a fairy tale

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:42.330
Don't tell me it will only be this once, darling
I am on the same ark

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:46.750
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:51.300
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.720
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Yeah

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:58.640
Sha-ra-ran-la, Sha-ra-ran-la
Cinderella step

00:21:58.850 --> 00:21:59.850
Yeah

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:12.730
Welcome back.

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:15.860
I'm glad you're okay.

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:18.030
Kaisar, give me back Rocky.

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:19.490
Right.

00:22:23.750 --> 00:22:25.000
Good job.

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:28.000
Where are you going?

00:22:28.170 --> 00:22:31.040
This is as far as I go with you.

00:22:31.210 --> 00:22:33.090
Don't worry about him.

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:41.260
Azazel.

00:22:41.430 --> 00:22:43.350
Please help us.

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:44.850
Have you lost your mind?

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:49.730
Charioce was building a giant weapon
underneath Anatae.

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:52.570
Its power rivaled Bahamut's.

00:22:54.530 --> 00:22:59.160
I wish to see how the king
plans to use the weapon

00:22:59.320 --> 00:23:01.830
that had the power to drive back the gods.

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:03.950
You want to save the demons, don't you?

00:23:05.830 --> 00:23:06.960
Help us.

00:23:16.010 --> 00:23:19.260
Hurry up and take that collar off already.

00:23:20.840 --> 00:23:23.680
I'm not taking your charity.

00:23:31.310 --> 00:23:33.820
Well, I'll be off then.

00:23:42.530 --> 00:23:45.910
Still a brat 10 years on.

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:49.290
Knight Kaisar, how have you been?

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:51.620
I still do not have anyone to call a friend...

00:23:51.790 --> 00:23:53.040
Occasionally...you.

00:23:53.630 --> 00:23:57.130
Next time on Rage of Bahamut:
Virgin Soul, "Virgin Souls"

00:23:57.460 --> 00:24:00.050
-I heard the Lord's voice!
-It's as though he's right beside you, isn't it?

00:24:00.220 --> 00:24:01.220
But, you are?

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:03.930
BAHA SOUL!!

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:06.470
Baha baha baha soul!

00:24:06.720 --> 00:24:08.930
Make sure to watch next time!

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:10.890
Sincerly,
the aristocrat, Kaisar.
